{"schemaVersion":2,"sectionID":9969,"chapterID":77,"chapterNumber":"4","sectionNumber":"28-413.3","title":"§ 28-413.3 Fitness to perform work.","sourceHTMLPath":"code-sections/general-administrative-provisions/chapters/Chapter 4.html","blocks":[{"id":"9969-html-1","kind":"html","html":"</div><div class=\"clearfix\"></div><div id=\"rid-0-0-0-160016\" class=\"rbox Normal-Level\"><AnnotationDrawer recordId=\"0-0-0-160016\"></AnnotationDrawer><div>As a condition of license renewal, a licensed high-pressure boiler operating engineer shall provide evidence satisfactory to the department that such licensee is fit to perform the work.</div></div><div class=\"clearfix\"></div><div id=\"rid-0-0-0-160017\" class=\"rbox Normal-Level\"><AnnotationDrawer recordId=\"0-0-0-160017\"></AnnotationDrawer><div>(Am. L.L. 2021/126, 11/7/2021, eff. 11/7/2022) \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div></div><div class=\"clearfix\"></div><div id=\"rid-0-0-0-160018\" class=\"rbox Normal-Level\"><AnnotationDrawer recordId=\"0-0-0-160018\"></AnnotationDrawer><div class=\"EdNoteSm\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;font-style: normal;text-decoration:none;display: inline;\">Editor's note:</span> For related unconsolidated provisions, see Appendix A at <Link class=\"Jump\" to=\"{{ pathname: '/codes/newyorkcity/latest/NYCadmin/0-0-0-135195', hash: '#JD_L.L.2021/126' }}\">L.L. 2021/126</Link>. \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div></div><div class=\"clearfix\"></div><div class=\"clearfix\"></div></div>\n<div><span depth=\"6\"></span><CodeOptions destID=\"rid-0-0-0-160019\" class=\"Article\"></CodeOptions><div id=\"rid-0-0-0-160019\" class=\"Article toc-destination rbox\" style=\"margin-top: .5rem\"><AnnotationDrawer recordId=\"0-0-0-160019\"></AnnotationDrawer><h6>Article 414: Reserved</h6></div><div class=\"clearfix\"></div><div class=\"clearfix\"></div></div>\n<div><span depth=\"6\"></span><CodeOptions destID=\"rid-0-0-0-160020\" class=\"Article\"></CodeOptions><div id=\"rid-0-0-0-160020\" class=\"Article toc-destination rbox\" style=\"margin-top: .5rem\"><AnnotationDrawer recordId=\"0-0-0-160020\"></AnnotationDrawer><h6><a name=\"JD_28-415\" id=\"JD_28-415\" title=\"28-415\"></a>Article 415: Sign Hanger License</h6></div><div class=\"clearfix\"></div><div class=\"clearfix\"></div></div>","plainText":"As a condition of license renewal, a licensed high-pressure boiler operating engineer shall provide evidence satisfactory to the department that such licensee is fit to perform the work. (Am. L.L. 2021/126, 11/7/2021, eff. 11/7/2022) Editor's note: For related unconsolidated provisions, see Appendix A at L.L. 2021/126 . Article 414: Reserved Article 415: Sign Hanger License"}]}
